Adapted from Exciter at c3f81ae:
- Makefile, mk/go.mk, biome.mk, actions.mk and stack.mk: renamed to Rotor, cut
  to Rotor's services, each area's targets defined only once its directory
  exists, the port slots moved to 30000-32759
- run-tests.sh, scripts/build-stamp.sh, go-test.sh, test-summary.sh and
  stack-ports.sh, tests/test-build-stamp.sh, test-ci.sh, test-ports.sh and
  test-stack.sh: renamed, with a check-python layer and Rotor's clients
- .claude/hooks/branch-guard.sh, gate-layers.sh, issue-context.sh and
  tests/branch-guard-test.sh, .claude/settings.json and .claude/skills/gh:
  renamed, with a check-python layer
- .github/workflows/ci.yml, .github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE and
  .github/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE.md: one browser shard, a uv cache, and run and
  sandbox fields in the bug template
- CLAUDE.md, CONTRIBUTING.md and SECURITY.md: rewritten for Rotor in the same
  shape
- deploy/docker-compose.yml, deploy/postgres/init-roles.sh: the
  infrastructure services without the replica, object store and mail
- deploy/keycloak/realm.json and realm-check.mjs: the suite's realm, with
  Rotor's clients and group added
- biome.json, .gitignore and .dockerignore

